      "issue": "CPU limit is 50m (0.05 CPU) while the container executes CPU_ITERATIONS=500000 PBKDF2 work on every request to '/', and the load generator sends 4 requests/second. This is far below the CPU required, causing severe CPU throttling and high request latency/timeouts.",
